                                    	<span class="wic DB08" title="눈">눈</span>
                                    	<span class="wic DB09" title="소나기">소나기</span>
                                    	<span class="wic DB10" title="빗방울">빗방울</span>
                                    	<span class="wic DB11" title="빗방울/눈날림">빗방울/눈날림</span>
                                    	<span class="wic DB12" title="눈날림">눈날림</span>
